[
  {
    "scene": "scene-01-1",
    "start": 0,
    "end": 6.4,
    "duration": 6.4,
    "text": "企业多业务线、多系统并行迭代时，困难不只是写代码，",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/chapter-01-release-chaos.html",
    "audioDuration": 5.29,
    "audioStart": 0.1,
    "audioEnd": 5.39,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-01-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-01-2",
    "start": 5.6,
    "end": 16.4,
    "duration": 10.8,
    "text": "而是让业务、研发、测试和投产在同一条时间线上协同。传统研发依赖零散沟通、人工排期和经验判断，",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/chapter-01-release-chaos.html",
    "audioDuration": 10.51,
    "audioStart": 5.47,
    "audioEnd": 15.98,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-01-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-01-3",
    "start": 15.6,
    "end": 28,
    "duration": 12.4,
    "text": "常常带来需求不规范、纳版无依据、变更无约束、沟通无留痕，最终形成版本冲突、风险失控和问题难追溯。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/chapter-01-release-chaos.html",
    "audioDuration": 11.7,
    "audioStart": 16.05,
    "audioEnd": 27.75,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-01-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-02-1",
    "start": 28,
    "end": 36,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "从混乱协同，到版本火车治理。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-02.html",
    "audioDuration": 4.18,
    "audioStart": 28.6,
    "audioEnd": 32.78,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-02-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-02-2",
    "start": 36,
    "end": 48,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "Biz 是新增的业务治理能力，DevOps 是原有工具链底座；持续集成｜持续部署；需求｜班次｜容量｜依赖｜变更。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-02.html",
    "audioDuration": 11.92,
    "audioStart": 36.04,
    "audioEnd": 47.96,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-02-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-02-3",
    "start": 48,
    "end": 58,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "它不是流程线上化，而是发布治理容器；可管控｜可追溯｜智能交付闭环。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-02.html",
    "audioDuration": 9.04,
    "audioStart": 48.24,
    "audioEnd": 57.28,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-02-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-03-1",
    "start": 58,
    "end": 70,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "需求散落，是协同失控的起点；统一需求池｜结构化字段。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-03.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.27,
    "audioStart": 58.6,
    "audioEnd": 65.87,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-03-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-03-2",
    "start": 70,
    "end": 82,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "需求先标准化，协同才有基础；评审｜纳版｜交付都有清晰依据。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-03.html",
    "audioDuration": 8.68,
    "audioStart": 70.6,
    "audioEnd": 79.28,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-03-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-04-1",
    "start": 82,
    "end": 90,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "在需求提交前，系统引入 AI 需求审查和智能补全能力。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-04.html",
    "audioDuration": 6.7,
    "audioStart": 82.325,
    "audioEnd": 89.025,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-04-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-04-2",
    "start": 90,
    "end": 100,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "AI 会自动校验需求完整性，识别潜在风险和模糊表达，并补齐缺失的验收标准与备注。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-04.html",
    "audioDuration": 9.108,
    "audioStart": 90.223,
    "audioEnd": 99.331,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-04-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-04-3",
    "start": 100,
    "end": 111,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "过去靠人工开会查漏的环节，现在可以在需求源头完成质量把关，把一句话需求提前拦截在评审之前。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-04.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.056,
    "audioStart": 100.6,
    "audioEnd": 107.65599999999999,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-04-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-05-1",
    "start": 111,
    "end": 119,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "在发布协同层面，我们搭建了专业化版本火车班次体系。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-05.html",
    "audioDuration": 6.12,
    "audioStart": 111.47,
    "audioEnd": 117.59,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-05-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-05-2",
    "start": 119,
    "end": 128,
    "duration": 9,
    "text": "版本火车不是普通排期表，而是发布计划容器。每个班次精准绑定关联系统、研发容量、关键节点和版本快照。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-05.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.74,
    "audioStart": 119.315,
    "audioEnd": 127.05499999999999,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-05-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-05-3",
    "start": 128,
    "end": 136,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "让多系统并行发布拥有标准化、可落地、可存档的执行依据。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-05.html",
    "audioDuration": 6.228,
    "audioStart": 128.443,
    "audioEnd": 134.67100000000002,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-05-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-06-1",
    "start": 136,
    "end": 145,
    "duration": 9,
    "text": "针对人工纳版凭感觉、产能过载、依赖冲突，多方业务所有需求都紧急、研发产能无法全部承接的核心矛盾。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-06.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.56,
    "audioStart": 136.36,
    "audioEnd": 143.92000000000002,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-06-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-06-2",
    "start": 145,
    "end": 155,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "系统上线 AI 智能纳版能力。它会综合需求优先级、研发容量、上下游依赖和业务紧急度。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-06.html",
    "audioDuration": 8.244,
    "audioStart": 145.439,
    "audioEnd": 153.683,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-06-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-06-3",
    "start": 155,
    "end": 163,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "生成可解释的纳版方案，清楚说明哪些需求适合上车，哪些需要暂缓，以及背后的容量和风险原因。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-06.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.452,
    "audioStart": 155.137,
    "audioEnd": 162.589,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-06-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-06-4",
    "start": 163,
    "end": 167,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "纳版从经验拍板，升级为可解释决策。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-06.html",
    "audioDuration": 3.708,
    "audioStart": 163.08,
    "audioEnd": 166.788,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-06-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-07-1",
    "start": 167,
    "end": 175,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "封板，是版本治理的分水岭；分级变更管控。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-07.html",
    "audioDuration": 5.832,
    "audioStart": 167.542,
    "audioEnd": 173.374,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-07-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-07-2",
    "start": 175,
    "end": 185,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "封板前留痕，封板后审批；系统发起｜双层审批｜风险评估｜审计留痕。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-07.html",
    "audioDuration": 9.468,
    "audioStart": 175.133,
    "audioEnd": 184.601,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-07-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-07-3",
    "start": 185,
    "end": 196,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "每一次变更都可追溯、可评估、可审计。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-07.html",
    "audioDuration": 4.212,
    "audioStart": 185.6,
    "audioEnd": 189.81199999999998,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-07-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-08-1",
    "start": 196,
    "end": 204,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "群聊里的变更，算不算流程？；@需求变更助手。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-08.html",
    "audioDuration": 4.644,
    "audioStart": 196.6,
    "audioEnd": 201.244,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-08-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-08-2",
    "start": 204,
    "end": 213,
    "duration": 9,
    "text": "AI 自动解析群聊变更；自动解析｜识别需求｜影响分析。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-08.html",
    "audioDuration": 6.48,
    "audioStart": 204.6,
    "audioEnd": 211.07999999999998,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-08-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-08-3",
    "start": 213,
    "end": 222,
    "duration": 9,
    "text": "临时沟通，沉淀为可治理数据；系统建档｜留痕｜变更台账。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-08.html",
    "audioDuration": 7.344,
    "audioStart": 213.414,
    "audioEnd": 220.75799999999998,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-08-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-08-4",
    "start": 222,
    "end": 226,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "沟通变成治理数据；可治理数据。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-08.html",
    "audioDuration": 3.708,
    "audioStart": 222.08,
    "audioEnd": 225.788,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-08-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-09-1",
    "start": 226,
    "end": 234,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "各看各的，协同就会失真；仪表盘｜日历视图。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-09.html",
    "audioDuration": 5.544,
    "audioStart": 226.6,
    "audioEnd": 232.144,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-09-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-09-2",
    "start": 234,
    "end": 242,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "一套数据，统一所有角色认知；排期｜容量｜变更率｜风险｜待办。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-09.html",
    "audioDuration": 6.408,
    "audioStart": 234.398,
    "audioEnd": 240.80599999999998,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-09-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-09-3",
    "start": 242,
    "end": 248,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "统一认知，降低沟通成本；一套真实数据。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-09.html",
    "audioDuration": 4.788,
    "audioStart": 242.303,
    "audioEnd": 247.091,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-09-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-10-1",
    "start": 248,
    "end": 257,
    "duration": 9,
    "text": "更重要的是，本项目不是简单叠加 AI 功能，而是以 AI 原生方式重构研发过程。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-10.html",
    "audioDuration": 8.28,
    "audioStart": 248.18,
    "audioEnd": 256.46,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-10-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-10-2",
    "start": 257,
    "end": 270,
    "duration": 13,
    "text": "我们通过智能 Agent 调度和领域上下文沉淀，打通 PRD、设计文档、测试案例与代码结构的双向映射。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-10.html",
    "audioDuration": 12.204,
    "audioStart": 257.199,
    "audioEnd": 269.403,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-10-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-10-3",
    "start": 270,
    "end": 282,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "结合 AI Skills、TDD 和 Playwright 自动化测试，形成文档联动、代码审查和自动化测试资产沉淀的质量闭环。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-10.html",
    "audioDuration": 9.468,
    "audioStart": 270.6,
    "audioEnd": 280.06800000000004,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-10-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-10-4",
    "start": 282,
    "end": 290,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "不是产品加 AI，而是研发过程 AI 原生化。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-10.html",
    "audioDuration": 5.4,
    "audioStart": 282.6,
    "audioEnd": 288,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-10-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-11-1",
    "start": 290,
    "end": 294,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "我们彻底告别经验化协同，",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-11.html",
    "audioDuration": 2.268,
    "audioStart": 290.433,
    "audioEnd": 292.70099999999996,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-11-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "scene": "scene-11-2",
    "start": 294,
    "end": 297,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "实现 AI 原生 BizDevOps 智能治理工具链。",
    "source": "compositions/scenes/scene-11.html",
    "audioDuration": 3.024,
    "audioStart": 294,
    "audioEnd": 297.024,
    "file": "assets/media/audio/voiceover/scene-11-2.mp3"
  }
]